001EAD  3                                               ; CALCULATE DELTAX
001EAD  3  38                   SEC                     ; Set Carry flag (represents "no borrow" for 1st byte)
001EAE  3  AD 89 18             LDA     LINEX1          ; Load low byte of number 1
001EB1  3  ED 8D 18             SBC     LINEX2          ; Subtract low byte of number 2 with carry
001EB4  3  8D 91 18             STA     DELTAX          ; Store result low byte
001EB7  3  AD 8A 18             LDA     LINEX1+1        ; Load high byte of number 1
